================================================================================
  * WIDTH / len axis (#499's axis): NOT SWEPT.  The probe uses only lw/sw/ld/sd.  DISCLOSED as
    coverage debt by the measuring seat and carried forward -- not silently absent.
  * POSITION / translation (clause (f)): NOT SWEPT.  No row asserts WHICH cell an access lands
    on.  Disclosed.
  * The two READ-arm announces (sites 1 and 2): already rowed and already killed by table 1's
    siblings; no new mutant owed.
  * ip30setisrassign (set_isr ASSIGNS where the pair implies OR): FILED as its own row, not a
    cell of this enumeration -- it is a BEHAVIOUR defect in a path this round only
    de-fatalises, and the addition licence declines "while we are here".
